abstract: >-
  An open dataset of 19,688 active England and Wales registered charities
  that operate internationally, built from the Charity Commission's public
  register extract (snapshot 9 July 2026), geocoded to head-office
  postcodes, and classified with one primary and up to two secondary UN
  Sustainable Development Goals plus a three-way overseas-engagement flag
  by a large language model (Claude Haiku 4.5, named here once for
  reproducibility). Validated against a blind hand-labelled sample of 150
  charities: 77.3% strict primary-SDG accuracy (95% CI 70.0 to 83.3%).
